Description: cantcp SocketCAN-to-TCP gateway daemon
 cantcpd bridges one Linux SocketCAN interface and TCP clients speaking the
 cantcp protocol. The connection is either plain (trusted perimeter) or
 TLS 1.3; the daemon serves JSON statistics and Prometheus metrics over
 HTTP and reloads the TLS material on SIGHUP.
